  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner Capacity Strengthening.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project overall objective is to  strengthen  CAFOD local/national partner capacity in the areas of Project Management so as to support communities and constituencies effectively. The project target 20 members from CAFOD partner to  be trained in  proposal development , financial and programme reporting. Partner capacity strengthening is in line with CAFOD partnership approach as well as the government Sudan priority on strengthening local/ national actors. 
 Project activities include:
1.	Development of ToR for an external consultancy to carry out capacity strengthening on proposal development, programme reporting and finance management for 4 CAFOD partners through tailor made training to 20 staff and  make follow ups.
2.	Cross learning and sharing platform for 3 partner staff and 1 CAFOD staff with other CAFOD E.A partners</narrative>
  </description>
